[32m+[m[32m## 5. [NEW, v0.1.5, EXPERIMENTAL/BETA] Hybrid JAX-forward + Pallas-backward path[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Status:** landed in `beta/` as an opt-in experimental path, not wired[m
[32m+[m[32minto `model.py` or the public `gdn2_forward_trainable` dispatcher. Not a[m
[32m+[m[32mlong-term architectural direction -- a stopgap pending section 1.[m
